    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launching Over It</strong> is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer\u2019s childhood memories. To reach the end, you\u2019ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles\u2014by launching a ball. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Golfing Over It with Alva Majo</i>, this game will test your patience, skill, and determination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frustrating, yet fair gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk of starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based launching mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References to iconic places, series, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic and emotional ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the top?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launching Over It</strong> is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer\u2019s childhood memories. To reach the end, you\u2019ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles\u2014by launching a ball. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Golfing Over It with Alva Majo</i>, this game will test your patience, skill, and determination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frustrating, yet fair gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk of starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based launching mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References to iconic places, series, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic and emotional ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the top?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stretch, launch, fail, repeat. The only way is up.",
